---
import GoogleMaterialSymbol from "../../custom/googleMaterial_Symbol.astro";
---

<div
  class="flex flex-col items-center jusitfy-center w-full h-fit gap-4 text-[min(5vw,1rem)] text-Light_Text_Primary dark:text-Dark_Text_Primary"
>
  <p class="font-bold text-[min(7vw,4rem)] capitalize text-nowrap">
    our core values
  </p>
  <p
    class="flex w-full lg:max-w-[70%] xl:max-w-[65%] text-center text-Light_Text_Secondary dark:text-Dark_Text_Secondary"
  >
    These aren't just technical features — they're our guiding beliefs. In a
    world full of noise, ads, and data-hungry platforms, YokaiVerse stands for
    clarity, freedom, and fan-powered evolution. Whether you're here to read,
    watch, share, or create — you're part of something built on passion, not
    profit.
  </p>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center w-full h-fit px-4 md:px-8 mt-4"
  >
    <a
      class="flex flex-row items-center jusitfy-center w-full lg:w-fit h-fit p-4 rounded-3xl gap-2 bg-Light_Secondary dark:bg-Dark_Secondary hover:bg-Light_Secondary_Hover dark:hover:bg-Dark_Secondary_Hover border border-Light_Border_Primary dark:border-Dark_Border_Primary hover:border-transparent outline outline-transparent hover:outline-Light_Border_Primary hover:dark:outline-Dark_Border_Primary hover:outline-offset-2 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"
      target="_blank"
      href="https://github.com/Yushtify/YokaiVerse"
    >
      <GoogleMaterialSymbol
        SVG_Name="person"
        SvgSize="!text-[min(7vw,1.2rem)]"
        isFilled={true}
      />
      <span>Open Source</span>
    </a>
    <div
      class="flex flex-row items-center jusitfy-center w-full lg:w-fit h-fit p-4 gap-2"
    >
      <GoogleMaterialSymbol
        SVG_Name="check"
        SvgSize="!text-[min(7vw,1.2rem)]"
        isFilled={true}
      />
      <span>private and always up-to-date</span>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-row items-center jusitfy-center w-full lg:w-fit h-fit p-4 gap-2"
    >
      <GoogleMaterialSymbol
        SVG_Name="groups"
        SvgSize="!text-[min(7vw,1.2rem)]"
        isFilled={true}
      />
      <span>Community Supported</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
